@host = http://localhost:5000

### Enqueue a welcome email (idempotent per address)
POST {{host}}/signups
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ada@example.com", "name": "Ada" }

### One that fails twice and then succeeds (watch the retries in the dashboard API)
POST {{host}}/signups
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "grace@flaky.example", "name": "Grace" }

### Dashboard API
GET {{host}}/slowcooker/api/stats

###
GET {{host}}/slowcooker/api/jobs?state=failed&take=20

###
GET {{host}}/slowcooker/api/recurring

###
POST {{host}}/slowcooker/api/recurring/daily-report-eu/trigger
